    "display_name": "Web Lab",
    "long_instructions": "# Create your Website with AI\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Start by describing the website that you selected in the previous level into AI Tutor to create a first draft.\r\n_**Note**: AI Tutor can be found by clicking the robot icon on the right side._\r\n\r\n2. Accept or reject the changes to the website that AI Tutor makes. Add a decription when accepting.\r\n\r\n2. Select three of the details from your Activity Guide and input them one at a time. Accept or reject the changes.\r\n\r\n3. Have fun! Work with AI Tutor to add other design elements.\r\n",
